<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING STAYS AT 62 BLN LEVS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING STAYS AT 62 BLN LEVS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian National Bank's (BNB)</p>
<p>refinancing to commercial banks stood at 62.044 billion levs on</p>
<p>November 8, unchanged from November 1, BNB preliminary figures</p>
<p>showed.</p>
<p>  BNB refinancing, mln levs	NOV 8     NOV 1    OCT 25</p>
<p>  Uncollaterlised deposits	 8,616     8,616     8,616</p>
<p>  Lombard loans			5,585     5,858     5,858</p>
<p>  Discount loans			   0	   0	   0</p>
<p>  Overdraft				107	 107	 107</p>
<p>  Overdue loans and deposits    47,463    47,463    47,463</p>
<p>  Total loans and deposits	62,044    62,044    63,061</p>
<p>  BNB treasury porfolio	   75,975    79,270    80,337</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
